do_2 = "Return LXP_ERR_ASSET_MISMATCH (include/layerx/lxp_result.h:81) for a denom with no mapping, the code asset_load returns for an unknown asset (src/modules/asset/lx_asset_execution.h:10-26)."
do_3 = "AssetRecord(assetId) reads paused and supply through lx_asset_lookup (include/layerx/lx_asset.h:242) and lx_asset_total_units (include/layerx/lx_asset.h:273) via the shim; no Go code reads the asset: key of asset_key (src/modules/asset/lx_asset_execution.h:4-8)."
