do_5 = "Keep ErrUnauthorized (modules/tokenfactory/types/errors.go:14) as the refusal for a non-admin sender; no new code is added for that case."
do_6 = "Add MsgSetDenomPaused Route, Type, ValidateBasic, GetSignBytes and GetSigners to modules/tokenfactory/types/msgs.go following SetDenomMetadata (modules/tokenfactory/types/msgs.go:202-234)."
do_7 = "ValidateBasic checks the sender bech32 address and the denom with GetTokenDenom, refusing a malformed denom with the error SetDenomMetadata uses."
do_8 = "Register MsgSetDenomPaused in RegisterCodec and RegisterInterfaces of modules/tokenfactory/types/codec.go beside the existing tokenfactory messages."
do_9 = "Add TestMsgSetDenomPaused to modules/tokenfactory/types/msgs_test.go covering a valid message, an empty sender and a denom outside the factory namespace."
do_10 = "Keep amino names in the tokenfactory/ prefix used by the other messages so legacy signing stays stable."
do_11 = "Add DenomPausedPrefixKey = \"paused\" beside the prefixes at modules/tokenfactory/types/keys.go:28-33 and a GetDenomPausedKey(denom) helper joined with KeySeparator (modules/tokenfactory/types/keys.go:25)."
do_12 = "Create modules/tokenfactory/keeper/pause.go with IsDenomPaused(ctx, denom) and setDenomPaused(ctx, denom, paused) on the keeper storeKey (modules/tokenfactory/keeper/keeper.go:14-30)."
do_13 = "setDenomPaused returns ErrPauseUnchanged (LXP_PAUSED_SCOPE) when the stored value equals the requested one, the rule of src/modules/asset/lx_asset_execution.h:243."
do_14 = "Add SendEnabledChecker(ctx, denom) bool on the keeper returning !IsDenomPaused, for the bank hook of task 1.2.2."
do_15 = "Create modules/tokenfactory/keeper/pause_test.go with TestDenomPauseStore: default false, set true, repeat refused, set false."
do_16 = "Add SetDenomPaused to the msg server in modules/tokenfactory/keeper/msg_server.go beside SetDenomMetadata (modules/tokenfactory/keeper/msg_server.go:188): read GetAuthorityMetadata (modules/tokenfactory/keeper/admins.go:11-20) and refuse a sender other than the admin with ErrUnauthorized (modules/tokenfactory/types/errors.go:14), the check Mint performs at modules/tokenfactory/keeper/msg_server.go:107-109."
do_17 = "On success call setDenomPaused and emit a tokenfactory event set_denom_paused with denom and paused attributes."
