do_4 = "Refuse any other value with ErrInvalidAuthorityMetadata from modules/tokenfactory/types/errors.go, leaving the admin rule unchanged."
do_5 = "Keep the field optional so every existing denom (GetAuthorityMetadata, modules/tokenfactory/keeper/admins.go:11-20) decodes with an empty issuer_did; a bring-up at the activation height, no account-state migration is required."
