do_1 = "Add modules/layerxexchange/native/context.go with BlockContext{Height, ReceiptIndex, BlockOpenMs} filled from the sdk.Context header time at block open; lxp_ctx_batch_timestamp_ms (read by batch_timestamp src/modules/perps/lx_perps_dispatch.c:103) returns BlockOpenMs for every receipt of the block."
do_2 = "Implement lxp_ctx_global_sequence as Height<<32 | ReceiptIndex, derived per call and never stored, matching the first-wave anchor task 1.1 shim; the perps place path stores it in the resting order (src/modules/perps/lx_perps_dispatch.c:1215) and the deficit record stores it as recorded_at_sequence (src/modules/perps/lx_perps_dispatch.c:1570)."
do_3 = "The oracle staleness and regression checks compare against BlockOpenMs (oracle_price_current src/modules/perps/lx_perps_dispatch.c:294-310; lx_oracle_check_staleness src/modules/perps/lx_oracle_checks.c:5-16), so every validator replays the same refusals."
do_4 = "Add modules/layerxexchange/native/context_test.go: TestBlockOpenTimestamp (receipts 0 and 9 of block 500 read 1700000500000) and TestDerivedGlobalSequence (height 500, receipt 9 gives 500<<32 | 9 and no counter key is written)."
