do_6 = "Write the tests interop/crates/x-websearch/tests/binary.rs with one case per acceptance of this task that they name (of 5.51.1, 5.51.2, 5.51.3, 5.43.1, 5.43.2, 5.43.3, 5.43.4), each using the real keeper, precompile or binary path whose behaviour starts at interop/crates/x-websearch/tests/binary.rs:204; no test double replaces the path under test."
do_7 = "This task carries the obligations of task 7.8 that fall on these files, all stated in the steps above; the anchor change is at interop/crates/x-websearch/tests/binary.rs:204."
do_8 = "Finish the entire scoped implementation first; then format touched files, run one build and verify_cmd once, at most two task-scoped repair cycles; record unrelated findings once in qualification.kvx without expanding scope."
