do_1 = "Delete the same-nonce replacement path (interop/crates/layerx-gas-station/src/station.rs:391-406) including the zero-value self-transfer it signs; a refused send leaves the nonce free for the next quote (interop/crates/layerx-gas-station/src/station.rs:589)."
do_2 = "Delete the journal record type for replacement (interop/crates/layerx-gas-station/src/journal.rs:94-99) and its signing intent (interop/crates/layerx-gas-station/src/journal.rs:174); journal replay of an earlier file holding such a record refuses with a clear version error (interop/crates/layerx-gas-station/src/journal.rs:1036)."
do_3 = "Rewrite recover (interop/crates/layerx-gas-station/src/station.rs:769) to read pax_sequencerReceipt for each journalled hash: committed records the quote as done, refused or unknown after the quote deadline frees the nonce."
