do_6 = "Add to interop/crates/layerx-gas-station/tests/station.rs a regression for a definitive sequencer rejection: sponsor nonce n, a type-4 submission refused by eth_sendRawTransaction with a deterministic underpriced rejection and no sequencer receipt is reported refused and its journal item is closed so the nonce is no longer held (journal holds and next_nonce, interop/crates/layerx-gas-station/src/journal.rs:378-406); a later quote from a different account takes nonce n; after a journal replay recover() does not rebroadcast the refused bytes; an ambiguous timeout or an unfinalized receipt keeps the existing unknown-outcome protection (pending, nonce held)."
