do_1 = "Re-point the lx review, approve and sign routes (human/wallet/gateway/src/routes/sign.ts:800) to EVM transaction review and send with the signed receipt; sign layerxledger issueGrant and payExact under the lx_grant kind (human/wallet/gateway/src/attestor/client.ts:69) with the quorum of human/wallet/gateway/src/env.ts:201 and human/wallet/gateway/src/env.ts:217."
do_2 = "Extend human/wallet/gateway/test/e2e/gateway.e2e.test.ts for review, send with receipt and grant signing; the test at human/wallet/gateway/test/e2e/gateway.e2e.test.ts:172 keeps its quorum recovery assertion."
do_3 = "Change the /v1/wallet/send handler (human/wallet/gateway/src/routes/sign.ts:549) so the call at human/wallet/gateway/src/routes/sign.ts:571 stores the receipt and the response body (human/wallet/gateway/src/routes/sign.ts:610) adds a receipt object beside tx_hash, address and chain_id."
