do_1 = "Seal runs MidBlock, WriteDeferredBalances, EndBlock and RouteCollectedFeeTokens in ProcessBlock order (node/app.go:2138, :2151, :2162, :2165)."
do_2 = "Seal closes L_N before total gas crosses the block limit checked by checkTotalBlockGas (node/app.go:1477; consensus/types/params.go:135-143)."
do_3 = "Seal stops at an upgrade height so the plan runs in the block path (node/app.go:1500 plan.ShouldExecute)."
do_4 = "The sealed slice and its execution are handed to FinalizeBlocker for adoption through the optimistic path (node/app.go:1486-1495, :1587-1604)."
do_5 = "Seal emits the MsgSequenceBatch fields from the seqHash chain for tx 0 of the proposal (consensus/internal/state/execution.go:131 is where the proposal block is built)."
