ac_1 = "layerxCustody at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001013 keeps its registration (precompiles/setup.go:83) and all twenty methods return Error(string) LXP_MODULE_DISABLED (include/layerx/lxp_result.h:42) at or above the merge plan height through the gate pattern of modules/layerxcustody/keeper/keeper.go:42; it releases chain funds against kernel state proofs and keeps an escape hatch for a stopped kernel sequencer (precompiles/layerxcustody/layerxcustody.go:6, :69; modules/layerxcustody/keeper/msg_server.go:13; precompiles/layerxcustody/layerxcustody_test.go:213)."
