[req.11006]
title = "Guarantor bond and challenge deposit return at the merge plan height"
ac_1 = "The merge plan handler returns every posted guarantor bond: for each record from GetGuarantors (modules/layerxanchor/keeper/guarantors.go:21) it moves Bond (modules/layerxanchor/types/state.go:61) from the anchor module account (modules/layerxanchor/keeper/keeper.go:30) to Operator (modules/layerxanchor/types/state.go:60) with a bank send, the reverse of the escrow at modules/layerxanchor/keeper/guarantors.go:86."
ac_2 = "Every pending unbonding entry from GetUnbondings (modules/layerxanchor/keeper/guarantors.go:34) is paid out at the plan height: Amount (modules/layerxanchor/types/state.go:72) goes to Operator (modules/layerxanchor/types/state.go:71) without waiting for CompleteUnbond (modules/layerxanchor/keeper/guarantors.go:183)."
ac_3 = "Every open challenge deposit from GetChallenges (modules/layerxanchor/keeper/challenges.go:18) is refunded to Challenger (modules/layerxanchor/types/state.go:138) for its Bond (modules/layerxanchor/types/state.go:139) in the shape of the refund at modules/layerxanchor/keeper/challenges.go:93, and the challenge leaves the open status (modules/layerxanchor/types/state.go:140)."
ac_4 = "The sum of all amounts returned equals the anchor module balance before the handler and the module balance is zero after it; no custody claim is drained (decision.4), and the anchor writes are retired at the same height (modules/layerxcustody/keeper/keeper.go:42)."

[req.11007]
title = "Anchor store-delete step"
ac_1 = "A later store-delete step deletes the layerxanchor store key (storage/common/keys/store_keys.go:35, :68; node/app.go:317) through StoreUpgrades Deleted in the shape of node/upgrades.go:377; its name and height are set at activation rehearsal."
ac_2 = "From the store-delete step the nine anchor reads (precompiles/layerxanchor/layerxanchor.go:260-281) return LXP_MODULE_DISABLED (include/layerx/lxp_result.h:42) while the address stays registered (precompiles/setup.go:83)."
ac_3 = "The anchor keeper wiring leaves the application: the keeper construction (node/app.go:722), the custody anchor reader (node/app.go:786) and the precompile keeper field (node/precompiles.go:61) are removed."
ac_4 = "The step runs only after the plan handler returned every bond and challenge deposit, so the deleted store holds no value; the guarantor list from GetGuarantors (modules/layerxanchor/keeper/guarantors.go:21) is empty of bonded value at that height."

