ac_1 = "The Explorer kernel-only views is deleted with its sources: it shows the second ledger anchors and receipts (explorer/backend/apps/indexer/lib/indexer/fetcher/paxeer_x_kernel_receipts.ex:1; explorer/frontend/ui/paxeerX/anchors/PaxeerXAnchorsTable.tsx:1)."
ac_2 = "Every live caller re-targets: native block and transaction pages show the data; the unified account folds into the native address page; the replacement is at rpc/block.go:257 and the first caller re-targeted is explorer/backend/apps/explorer/lib/explorer/chain/paxeer_x/unified_account.ex:118."
ac_3 = "The retirement lands only after the kernel receipt history decision for pre-activation records; references inside the deleted trees, such as explorer/backend/apps/block_scout_web/lib/block_scout_web/controllers/api/v2/paxeer_x/anchor_controller.ex:42, explorer/backend/apps/block_scout_web/lib/block_scout_web/controllers/api/v2/paxeer_x/receipt_controller.ex:54, leave with the deletion."
ac_4 = "After the retirement the retired-caller check finds no live non-test reference to PaxeerXKernelReceipts, paxeer-x/anchors, paxeer-x/receipts outside the deleted trees across the 17 caller files, including explorer/backend/apps/indexer/lib/indexer/application.ex:16, :92, :93."

[req.11049]
title = "Mirror kernel-checkpoint input"
ac_1 = "The Mirror kernel-checkpoint input is kept and re-pointed rather than deleted: it publishes kernel checkpoints to remote chains, so its input is the anchored kernel checkpoint (interop/crates/layerx-mirror/src/node.rs:551, :711; interop/crates/layerx-mirror/src/publisher.rs:8; interop/crates/layerx-mirror/src/runtime.rs:17)."
ac_2 = "Every live caller re-targets: the mirror is kept and re-pointed: it publishes the committed header and app hash read from a full node at the mirrored height, and finality is block height and commit; the replacement is at rpc/block.go:257, custodyproof/verify.go:260 and the first caller re-targeted is interop/crates/layerx-mirror/src/node.rs:551, :711; interop/crates/layerx-mirror/src/publisher.rs:8; interop/crates/layerx-mirror/src/runtime.rs:17."
ac_3 = "The retirement lands only after the committed-header read available from a full node; references inside the deleted trees, such as interop/crates/layerx-mirror/src/node.rs:551, :711; interop/crates/layerx-mirror/src/publisher.rs:8; interop/crates/layerx-mirror/src/runtime.rs:17, leave with the deletion."
ac_4 = "After the retirement the retired-caller check finds no live non-test reference to statusOf, LniArchiveSource, CheckpointSubmitted outside the deleted trees across the 0 caller files, including interop/crates/layerx-mirror/src/node.rs:551, :711; interop/crates/layerx-mirror/src/publisher.rs:8; interop/crates/layerx-mirror/src/runtime.rs:17."

[req.11050]
title = "Retired-caller check"
ac_1 = "tools/paxeer-x/tests/retired_callers_test.py reads tools/paxeer-x/retired_callers.json, which lists for every retired component its symbols, its deleted trees and its replacement, starting with the deleted-tree samples such as agent/crates/layerx-paxeer-verifier/src/contract.rs:9."
ac_2 = "The check scans tracked non-test files outside the deleted trees and exits 1 naming file:line for any live reference, for example a remaining reference like agent/crates/layerx-client/examples/go_verifier_vectors.rs:2; it exits 0 when none remain."
ac_3 = "The check takes --component and --path filters so each re-target task gates only its own files, and --self-test proves the matcher on fixed strings in the style of tools/paxeer-x/tests/routes_test.py:2."
ac_4 = "The check honours the kept paths: precompiles/setup.go:81-83 registrations and custodyproof/verify.go:260 are allowed references and never fail the check."

[req.11051]
title = "Build, image, workspace and rollout manifests"
ac_1 = "The build manifests drop every target of a retired component, including the replay golden targets (Makefile:84, :374, :381) and the build of Makefile:3609."
ac_2 = "The rollout manifest drops the relay archive and other retired units (deploy/rollout.kvx:155), and tools/rollout/tests/rollout.test.sh passes on the result."
ac_3 = "Workspace manifests drop retired members, such as interop/Cargo.toml:8 for the intent ingester, and every remaining workspace resolves with cargo metadata --locked."
ac_4 = "Image manifests drop retired binaries, such as docker/intent-ingester/Dockerfile:5, and no image copies a deleted path."

[req.11052]
title = "Activation rehearsal of the retirements"
ac_1 = "A four-node rehearsal applies the merge plan registered beside the activation plan (node/upgrades.go:88, :187) and listed in knownUpgradePlans (node/upgrades.go:416-418), in the style of integration_test/upgrade_module/major_upgrade_test.yaml:3; the plan name and height are set at this rehearsal."
ac_2 = "After the plan height every retired method of 0x1012, 0x1013, 0x1014 and 0x1015 returns LXP_MODULE_DISABLED (include/layerx/lxp_result.h:42) and every posted guarantor bond and open challenge deposit has been returned (modules/layerxanchor/keeper/guarantors.go:21)."
ac_3 = "After the store-delete step the anchor reads return LXP_MODULE_DISABLED and the store key (storage/common/keys/store_keys.go:35) is gone from the store."
ac_4 = "The retired-caller check exits 0 on the release revision with zero live references across every component, and the rollout test (tools/rollout/tests/rollout.test.sh:1) passes."

