ac_1 = "Non-sequencer nodes answer the pending tag with -32000 pending served by sequencer; the tag handling lives at rpc/utils.go:66."
ac_2 = "eth_subscribe newPendingTransactions on the sequencer emits receipted tx hashes, and the router relays it instead of the -32004 refusal (platform/hosted/gateway/src/paxeer.rs:172)."
