ac_1 = "The activation height is read from node config, and from it BeginBlock(N+1) is fed the votes of N-1 (node/legacyabci/begin_block.go:61)."
ac_2 = "Before the activation height the proposer reaps the mempool (consensus/internal/state/execution.go:126); from it the proposal takes the sealed receipt order."
